      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْزَبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A female slave:</i> (O, K:) or, accord. to
Th, applied only to a woman <i>that has not a husband:</i> (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَازِبُ</span>, for which <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَازِيبُ</span> occurs
in a verse of Aboo-Khirásh El-Hudhalee. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
